<SiteLayout title="Whitby - Places I want to visit">
  <h1>A weekend in Whitby</h1>
  <p>Whitby is a small harbour town on the Yorkshire coast. I've been once, for an
     afternoon, and it wasn't nearly long enough.</p>

  <h2>What interests me</h2>
  <p>The town sits on both sides of a river, with old streets running down to the
     harbour and the ruins of an abbey on the cliff above.</p>

  <h2>What I'd like to do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Climb the 199 steps to the abbey.</li>
    <li>Walk along the beach to Sandsend.</li>
    <li>Eat fish and chips on the harbour wall.</li>
  </ul>

  <p>Find out more on the <a href="https://www.visitwhitby.com/">Visit Whitby website</a>.</p>
</SiteLayout>
